      "mergedPostDetails": "https://hello.vrchat.com/community-guidelines\n\n`Do not use VRChat systems in a way intended to mislead, trick, fool, or confuse people.`\n\nCommunity Guidelines 5.6 already prohibits false or misleading world thumbnails, whether it is made by AI or otherwise Photoshopped.\n\nThe problem is not specific to AI usage per se.\n\nThe problem is the **epidemic of Community Guideline 5.6 violation** and **VRChat is not enforcing its own rules enough.**\n\nImmediate solutions:\n\n1. VRChat should start enforcing the rule on misleading AI world thumbnails.\n\n2. VRChat should actively monitor world thumbnails, and visit/check worlds with suspiciously good looking thumbnails.\n\n3. What you can do: **Report any misleading AI thumbnails for Community Guideline 5.6 violation.** Help VRChat do their job.",
